  "description": "OpenSky.AspNetCore is an extension library for ASP.NET Core that simplifies the integration of the `OpenSkyService` into ASP.NET Core applications. It provides extension methods for `IServiceCollection` to easily configure and add the `OpenSkyService` with dependency injection, allowing developers to seamlessly access weather data from WeatherAPI.com in their ASP.NET Core projects.",
